menu "C5VRX board"

    choice C5VRX_BOARD
        prompt "Board and video output"
        default C5VRX_BOARD_XIAO_DAC
        help
            Where the received video goes. The XIAO build recovers the
            composite waveform onto the six-bit resistor DAC.

        config C5VRX_BOARD_XIAO_DAC
            bool "XIAO ESP32-C5 with the resistor DAC (composite out)"

        config C5VRX_BOARD_FIREBEETLE_P4LINK
            bool "FireBeetle 2 ESP32-C5 as tuner of an ESP32-P4 display (P4 link)"
            help
                The full receiver runs as on the XIAO; the six-bit DAC codes
                leave on GPIO2..7 with the PARLIO TX clock on GPIO8, and
                UART GPIO11/12 carries status and commands. The ESP32-P4
                firmware in p4/ shows the picture and streams it over USB
                UVC (docs/P4LINK.md).
    endchoice

endmenu
